           <h2 class="project-title">MacStats</h2>
           <div class="project-desc prose">
 <p>Five menu bar items for a Mac, CPU, GPU, RAM, temperature and free disk space, each dropping down a
 panel that says what its number means. Every commit was written with Claude Code.</p>
 <p>It answers agents as well as people: from the command line it prints every panel&#39;s figures and
 draws any menu bar item to an image, so an agent can read and see what it changed. The same flags
 took the panel screenshots in its README.</p>
